# Core Rules

- App name is Yofai.
- Bundle ID is com.shawnwright.yofai.
- App type code word is Mosaic.
- Product purpose: local-first marketplace product photo preparation for online sellers.
- Core photo preparation is local-first/on-device.
- Marketplaces are local export targets only — not live publishing destinations.
- Export preset pixel sizes must not be invented; use verified sizes only.
- Keep changes small.
- Inspect files before editing.
- Do not refactor unrelated files.
- Do not implement paid/live AI APIs, OAuth marketplace publishing, or direct marketplace uploads unless explicitly re-approved.
- Backend, accounts, cloud sync, subscriptions, and ads are future-capability only — not current work unless newly approved as a phase.
- Report changed files, build result, and next needed approval.
- Use short, simple explanations.
